[ti:Kaa Rahasya]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Cinematic & Other]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]k..
[00:10.56]ka...
[00:13.12]kaa...
[00:15.68]kaaa...
[00:18.24]kyaa...
[00:20.80]ka kau ke
[00:23.36]ken kabhyaam kai
[00:25.93]kavim kaviim kavayah
[00:28.49]kahaam katham kathaam
[00:31.05]kasmin kyo keshu
[00:33.61]ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[00:36.17]kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[00:38.73]nai brahmaand racha daalaa
[00:41.29]e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[00:43.85]kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[00:46.41]kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[00:48.97]sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[00:51.53]chanddalaa de dna nai
[00:54.09]onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[00:56.65]ka... kaa... kya... kyo...
[00:59.22]kahan kab tak kisko kyon
[01:01.78]khalq khuda kufr karam
[01:04.34]khoon kaleje kaa, kaghaz kalam
[01:06.90]khaali karo kya kahe kabeer
[01:09.46]kankar kaahe karein taqeer
[01:12.02]kuttaa kaalaa kya jaane
[01:14.58]kaaba kaun, kaun but-khaana
[01:17.14]kaafir kahe kaaba chale
[01:19.70]qazi kahe qabar chale
[01:22.26]kaa de chakkar mein kaalaa phire
[01:24.82]kaal kaa kaal kahaan se tire
[01:27.38]kadaa na toota, kes na kaate
[01:29.95]kanghi na rukhi, karpaan na haathe
[01:32.51]kachcha kaahe kaa rakhdaa baandh
[01:35.07]kaal kaa khel, na jaane aadh
[01:37.63]khaak se kaaya, kaaya se kaam
[01:40.19]kaam se krodh, krodh se jaam
[01:42.75]kaun si kaayaa kaahe si kathaa
[01:45.31]kaa kaa rahasya – bas kaal kaa naath
[01:47.87]kahaam gaye sab kavim kaviim
[01:50.43]kavayah kaahe bane nayeem
[01:52.99]kasmin jag mein kyo nahi chain
[01:55.55]keshu hi to hai maaya mail
[01:58.11]ka kau ke – teeno paal
[02:00.67]ken kabhyaam – dohe ka jaal
[02:03.24]kai – kaahe ko kai baar
[02:05.80]kathaam katham – kahta hai koi bichaar
[02:08.36]ka kaa rahasya – kya bataaye
[02:10.92]kya likhe kaghaz kya mitaaye
[02:13.48]jeh kavan kahan kis karan
[02:16.04]so kaal – so khaas – so khanjar – so kiran
